(text "Transformer harness: J920/22/24/26 = primary leads (0 V / 115 V tap / 230 V end / SCN->PE), J921/23 + J925/28 + J927 = secondary leads - all Phoenix MSTBV 2,5/4-GF-5,08 flanged headers (1777099, 12 A / 320 V) + MSTB 2,5/4-STF-5,08 screw-clamp plugs (0.2-2.5 mm2 = 14-24 AWG, ample for every secondary incl. the paralleled 6 V windings).  NOTE: the idle tap bus stays live - TAP230 carries ~230 V even on 115 V mains and TAP115 sits at ~115 V on 230 V mains; both are mains-domain for spacing." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 270.000 140.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.20 1.20)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dfcb37a9-8641-4f1c-8405-d36af4918151"))
