(text "BYPS: 555 delay-OFF ~300 ms (270k x 1u) -> Q924 holds BYPSG low during charge -> S4 open; timeout -> BYPSG pulls up -> S4 closes.  SEL_PAR needs LOWLINE (opto ON = 115 V proof); SEL_SER asserts by default on 230 V (inverted comparator inputs)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 620.000 225.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.20 1.20)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "50f9081b-1e01-4942-9c98-ac5f33641a86"))
